 * `agents.on_agent_issue` here first would fail every pull request in this repository
 * until the release carrying it arrived. The update machinery three-way merges the
 * key in then, and that is the moment this entry goes.
 */
const PENDING_RELEASE = ["agents.on_agent_issue"];
```

and both tests filter it. Plus, to make sure the entry goes away (not silently forgotten), add:

```ts
